  "content": {
    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "home",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "key": "home",
          "title": "So, you're looking for a car from Japan?",
          "google_reviews_url": "https://share.google/gV9fNc1szaKmE150R",
          "sections": [
            {
              "_type": "opening",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-opening",
              "body": "Here at Origin, we have a large selection of imported vehicles in stock, already in the UK.",
              "link_label": "Showroom",
              "link_url": "/showroom"
            },
            {
              "_type": "stock",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-stock",
              "heading": "In the showroom"
            },
            {
              "_type": "feature",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-feature",
              "heading": "Personal imports",
              "body": "We provide a personal import service to help you find and secure a car from Japan. With access to many trade only auctions, we inspect these vehicles before purchase.",
              "image": {
                "provider": "external",
                "id": "",
                "src": "/images/suzuki-carry-sunset-1400.jpg",
                "alt": "A white Suzuki Carry kei truck at sunset",
                "width": 1400,
                "height": 1092
              },
              "link_label": "Personal Import Service",
              "link_url": "/personal-import"
            },
            {
              "_type": "section",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-section-2",
              "heading": "New and used parts",
              "body": "With access to Yahoo Japan and Up Garage, Origin can help you find the parts you are looking for, new or used."
            },
            {
              "_type": "section",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-section-3",
              "heading": "Trusted partners",
              "body": "In the import trade, partners in Japan are essential. With two trusted agents in Japan, both English speaking, Origin has the people to provide an efficient service."
            },
            {
              "_type": "reviews",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-reviews",
              "heading": "Brilliant reviews"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "personal-import",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "key": "personal-import",
          "title": "Personal Import Service",
          "sections": [
            {
              "_type": "opening",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "personal-import-opening",
              "body": "At Origin, we can help import most cars from Japan to order, working with two agents in Japan. From kei cars to sports cars, trucks and MPVs, we source Japanese and European models from auctions, dealers, and online auctions across Japan.\n\nWe understand that many people are nervous about importing a vehicle. It is a lot of money to spend on something you have never seen. We help you understand the process, and get your requirements, budget and expectations in place."
            },
            {
              "_type": "section",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "personal-import-section-1",
              "heading": "Sourcing",
              "body": "On your instruction, we search Japanese auctions, dealers and online auctions with dealer level software the public do not have. Once we find a car you want, we price it all in to the UK and give you a breakdown. Then we book an inspection."
            },
            {
              "_type": "section",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "personal-import-section-2",
              "heading": "Inspection",
              "body": "We inspect personal imports before bidding. You get the pictures before the bid, so you can decide before we place it."
            },
            {
              "_type": "section",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "personal-import-section-3",
              "heading": "Shipping",
              "body": "Once the car is secured, the Japan costs are due. Our agent collects the car, photographs it again, and organises insured shipping to the UK."
            },
            {
              "_type": "section",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "personal-import-section-4",
              "heading": "Prep",
              "body": "When the vehicle arrives, we collect it from the port and bring it to Newport. We MOT it, or IVA it if needed, register it, service it, detail it, and carry out any other work agreed. Then we can deliver it, or you can collect it."
            },
            {
              "_type": "photos",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "personal-import-photos",
              "heading": "Previous personal imports"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "grade-sheets",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "key": "grade-sheets",
          "title": "Grade Sheets",
          "sections": [
            {
              "_type": "opening",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "grade-sheets-opening"
            },
            {
              "_type": "section",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "grade-sheets-section-1",
              "heading": "What the grade means",
              "body": "An auction grade sheet is the inspector's note that comes with almost every car sold at a Japanese auction. Inspectors at each auction house look over the car before the sale and mark scratches, dents, and anything obvious. The overall grade is usually in a box at the top right of the sheet.\n\nImporters talk about a grade 4.5 car, or a grade 4 car. Treat that number as a guide. Different inspectors, and different auctions, are stricter or looser. A grade 3.5 at one auction may not match a grade 3.5 at another. The comments on the sheet are often more useful than the number. A grade sheet is not a full inspection. Origin can arrange a closer look before the auction, which matters more on an older car."
            },
            {
              "_type": "section",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "grade-sheets-section-2",
              "heading": "Grades",
              "body": "S or 6 means a car under 12 months old, in pristine condition inside and out. 5 is almost perfect, and hard to find. 4.5 is a strong grade, with only minor blemishes. 4 may have minor scratches or dents, and often has maintenance records.\n\n3.5 is the common grade, and it covers a wide range, so a pre-bid inspection is worth it. 3 needs bodywork or paint. RA has been repaired after minor accident damage. R has accident history, repaired or not. 2 has significant corrosion.\n\nA blank grade, 0, or a mark of three stars means the car was not inspected, has major damage, will not run, or is sold as it is."
            },
            {
              "_type": "section",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "grade-sheets-section-3",
              "heading": "Interior",
              "body": "Interior grades sit near the auction grade and run from A to E. A is the best."
            },
            {
              "_type": "section",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "grade-sheets-section-4",
              "heading": "Marks on the plan",
              "body": "The inspector also marks damage on a small plan of the car, bonnet at the top of the sheet. A mark on the top right of that plan is the front right wing. U is a dent: U1 the size of a thumb, U2 a palm, U3 larger. A is a scratch. Y is a tear, S is rust, C is corrosion, W is a repair, X means the panel needs replacing, and XX means it has been replaced."
            },
            {
              "_type": "exhibit",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "grade-sheets-exhibit"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "contact",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "key": "contact",
          "title": "Contact",
          "sections": [
            {
              "_type": "opening",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "contact-opening",
              "body": "Please feel free to ask any questions about a stock car or importing a vehicle. We will get back to you as soon as possible."
            },
            {
              "_type": "details",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "contact-details"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "privacy",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "key": "privacy",
          "title": "Privacy",
          "sections": [
            {
              "_type": "opening",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "privacy-opening",
              "body": "Origin Japan Ltd keeps the details you send when you ask about a vehicle, a personal import, or anything else. Your name, email, phone, and message are saved, and emailed to info@originjapan.co.uk. We use them to reply to you. We do not sell those details. To ask for a copy, or to ask us to delete them, email info@originjapan.co.uk."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "reviews": [
      {
        "id": "review-badeshi",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "name": "Badeshi",
          "quote": "Bought a nice clean car. Easy purchase, low pressure sale. Recommended seller of JDM and imported cars.",
          "order": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-jacob-dean",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "name": "Jacob Dean",
          "quote": "Adam was brilliant, transparent and very helpful. If I purchase another import it will definitely be through Origin Japan.",
          "order": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-emily-renshaw",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "name": "Emily Renshaw",
          "quote": "Adam has been excellent throughout the whole importing process, making it seamless and stress free for me.",
          "order": 3
        }
      }
    ]
